WEBVTT

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.580
Sure did catch me off guard...

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.630
Guess life throws you a curveball every now an' then...

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:31.170
Rokka Asahi, I'm scouting you!

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:39.130
N-no, thank you!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.960
Didn't mean to say that...

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.040
I could hardly believe it!

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.540
It was incredible, wasn't it?

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.210
My heart was pounding,
like I was watching some kind of drama unfold!

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.080
Why is she trying to scout LOCK all of a sudden?

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.920
Do they know each other?

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:05.080
CHU2-chan came to our
self-sponsored live show, but...

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.460
She never spoke to LOCK, did she?

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.710
You think she saw the Galaxy website or something?

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.250
The website's used to promote the bands.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.460
I doubt there's anything about LOCK written on there.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.920
Really...?

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.080
It's because LOCK is an amazing guitarist.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.250
Oh!

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.920
Sure, but how did she know LOCK
is an amazing guitarist?

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.290
A video, maybe?

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.380
Good point...

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:32.380
I wouldn't put it past that girl to have
stumbled upon LOCK herself.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:33.750
Saaya-chan?

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:38.670
She's a bit overbearing,
but she's got a serious passion for bands.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.540
Plus, it's obvious she really loves music.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.670
Yeah...

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:47.710
She always listened to a bunch of music
Rei and I didn't know existed.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.630
She even had a recording of Mortin's secret concert.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.630
Not only is she talented...

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.880
She's looking for a musician who inspires her.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.830
I'm guessing she heard LOCK
play the guitar and it got her fired up.

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:05.080
But good old LOCK turned down her offer, didn't she?

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.250
Yeah...

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:10.830
If I were in her shoes,
I'm not sure I'd be able to refuse...

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.580
That's LOCK, for you.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:16.040
It would be nerve-wracking even if she hadn't...

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.380
Focus, Kasumi.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:22.130
What are we going do?
About the "BanG Dream! Girls Band Challenge."

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:23.710
We enter, of course!

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.210
Figures.

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:26.540
Makes sense.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.920
Huh? What'd I miss?

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:30.250
CHU2-chan said she's gonna beat us to a pulp.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.830
I'm kind of worried...

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.710
If we hide underneath the table...

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.830
O-Tae!

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.500
Coochy-coochy-coo!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.170
What? It didn't work!

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:40.460
I'm immune.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.920
How 'bout here?!

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:45.170
Still immune.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:48.500
This contest is kinda turning into a big deal, huh?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.540
What do you think Yukina-senpai
and the others are gonna do...?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.250
Pass.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:57.920
In that case, let's consider our schedule finalized
in preparation for FUTURE WORLD FES.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:58.960
Okay!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:02.500
There's no way we can lose if we enter the contest...

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.830
But we upped our practice time...

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:10.080
She's right. If we try to cram in anything else,
you can kiss your sweet video games goodbye.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:47.750
Scared to Death

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.290
What's the matter?

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.710
I just can't wrap my head around yesterday...

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.250
Move! Move!

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:53.420
Cut it out, would you?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:54.710
What's going on over there?
Cut it out, would you?

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.420
No way! It's CHU2 from RAS!
Don't crowd me!

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:56.750
No way! It's CHU2 from RAS!
That's enough! Back off!

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.330
Cute!
That's enough! Back off!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.080
What are you doing here?!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:02.540
Give me some breathing room!

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:04.040
That's a Celosia Girls' uniform.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.000
That's a Celosia Girls' uniform.
Personal space, please! Go away!

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:06.630
It's an elite international school
with a prestigious reputation.
Personal space, please! Go away!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.380
It's an elite international school
with a prestigious reputation.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.330
There you are!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:20.830
My name is CHU2.
I'm the producer for RAISE A SUILEN.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.500
Uh, hello...

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.670
What business do you have with my Rokka?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.210
A manager?

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:32.960
Then I'll cut to the chase:
I've come here to scout Rokka Asahi for my band.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.000
"Manager"...?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.330
Forgive me, Asuka-chan!

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:36.170
Rokka?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.040
Wait-!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.960
I'm sorry!

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:41.000
Hold it right there!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:42.670
Oops...

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:45.500
Without an appointment, this could be problematic...

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:52.920
Hello, my name is CHU2.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:56.080
I'd like to request permission
to take a tour of your campus.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:57.920
Absolutely.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:01.580
The educational philosophy at Haneoka Girls'
High School resonates with me deeply.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.830
Of course.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.380
Thank goodness...

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.130
Did you hear Asahi-san got scouted?!

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.710
Whoa, that's crazy!

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.290
And for RAS, no less!

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:14.380
I mean, she's insanely good at guitar.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.630
Sounds like the rumors have started flying, huh?

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:22.380
Why'd she come here? I already turned her down...

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:23.750
You did?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.330
Her personality kinda scares me...

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.330
Oh...

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:29.460
Besides...

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:31.580
Wham, bam!

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:32.710
Squish, squash!

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.380
Squish, squash, squish, squash!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.250
Squish, squash, squish, squash!

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:41.080
Joining her band means
I'd have to squish PoPiPa into dango...

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.250
I refuse to let them squish PoPiPa!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.290
"Squish"...?

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.750
She must be tired.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.500
Rokka Asahi-san of Class 1-A.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.170
Please report to
the Student Council room immediately.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.080
Rokka Asahi-san of Class 1-A.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.670
Please report to
the Student Council room immediately.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.330
Excuse me.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:11.420
Um, I'm Rokka Asahi from Class 1-A.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:15.290
You, um... called for me?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:17.830
Hello.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.460
She's here!

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.250
How rude! You act like you've seen a ghost!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:25.630
Non-students aren't allowed to
enter the building without permission!

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.380
I happen to have permission to tour the campus.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.920
That's right. She's a visitor.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:32.880
Here's your tea.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:33.920
Thank you.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.000
Does your school-

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.080
I've already finished all of my academic credits.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.750
Attendance means practically nothing to me.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.710
But enough of that...
I insist you join my band this instant!

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:45.460
S-seriously...?

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:48.630
Um, how exactly do you know each other?

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:50.000
My guitarist!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.290
No, I'm not!

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.920
How hilarious!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.170
C'mon, this is serious...

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:58.630
This is your chance to join
my ultimate band, you know!

00:07:58.630 --> 00:07:59.580
"Ultimate"...?

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.580
Yes!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.830
With my music, we're going to crush
the Girl Band Generation!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:04.920
How awful!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:06.790
There's nothing to be afraid of!

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.040
Begin a new world!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.080
A world no one's ever seen!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.460
Time's up!

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.250
Afternoon classes are about to start...

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.130
I must concede for now...

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.130
Good luck with your classes.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.170
Later.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.710
Catch you later!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.130
Bye-bye!

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.080
Rough day, huh?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.630
I'm here to pick you up!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.630
With PAREO in tow!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:39.920
Run away!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.460
Go, PAREO!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.790
I can't keep this up much longer...

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.960
Don't you play sports, Asuka-chan?!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:55.130
I'm on the swim team! I'm not cut out for running!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:04.380
Ladies! Remember the procedure!

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:08.580
Stop, drop, and roll away from strangers!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:15.500
Wasn't that the producer for RAS who just ran by?

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:22.210
Unfortunately for us, the BanG Dream finals
and the Jizo Festival fall on the same day...

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:24.460
Are you sure about skipping the festival?

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.000
It's a big deal for the shopping district.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.580
I can't imagine they'd find someone
to perform in our place, y'know?

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:34.460
We ought to focus on polishing up
our skills for the Budokan.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:39.170
Moca-chan was born to shine in the shopping district!

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.170
Found her!

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.380
Rokka-sama!

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.330
Isn't that LOCK?

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.630
Here they come again...

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.630
What are they doing down there...?

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.460
C'mon, Miss Manager!

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:01.880
Where's Rokka?!

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.500
First of all, I'm not her manager.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.710
CHU2-sama, over there!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.790
Which way did she go?!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.170
Why am I even doing this in the first place?!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.000
Ow-!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.420
There! Go right!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.500
Run, run!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.790
Rokka, go!
Run, Rokka!

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.000
Would you shut up already?!

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.830
CHU2-sama, behind you!

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:27.670
The short one's kinda awkward...

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.380
Shake her off!

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:32.920
Indeed, there is time left before the sun sets.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:36.290
A dear friend has placed his life
in my hands without protest.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.670
I must prove myself worthy of his trust.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:41.790
Run, Melos!

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:44.460
Please stop running!

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:02.000
Oh, Rokka!

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.130
Where could she have gone...?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.920
Kitazawa Butchery

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.540
Welcome!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.920
Did you see a girl with glasses come this way?

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.380
Girl with glasses?

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.960
Rokka Asahi-sama.

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:22.580
Well, in that case...

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:27.130
She mentioned something about
needing a place to hide!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.040
PAREO.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.380
Yes, Master!

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.630
Not here... She must've escaped!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.330
Shall we try another time?

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.960
No! My search was finally over!

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.500
You saw the video of Rokka Asahi
at the cultural festival, didn't you?!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.920
I knew from the very first note
that she's exactly what RAS needs!

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:54.080
Her guitar skills are the real deal!

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.710
CHU2-sama...

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.420
Let's keep looking elsewhere.

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:14.580
I ended up with a lot of croquettes...

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.250
Did they follow me to the bathhouse...?!

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:30.880
Rokka-sama.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.000
CHU2-sama decided to take a break.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.790
Oh, thank goodness...

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:42.040
Does this mean you're opposed to joining a band?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.710
PAREO! Where are you, PAREO?!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:05.290
Stupid world built for tall people...!

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:07.130
Do you want a royal milk tea?

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.880
Yukina Minato!

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.790
Forget your wallet at home?

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.960
I never carry cash on me!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.500
Black coffee...

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.130
It's strong...

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.330
How ridiculous, being treated to coffee by my rival...

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.290
Rival?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.500
You still haven't given me an answer.

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:34.960
I already told you.
You're going to accept my challenge, aren't you?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.830
RAS is the band that's gonna beat you
Roselia idiots to a pulp!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:44.170
And our plan happens to include
the destruction of Poppin' Party.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.580
If you want to know why I rejected your offer...

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:51.170
It's because Roselia isn't a stage for you
to showcase your music.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:54.210
What's so bad about wanting to use my own music?!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:59.630
I shouldn't have to compromise my vision to create
a band with the perfect sound and members!

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.170
Yukina! Sorry I'm late.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.380
Thanks for the coffee.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:17.130
Enjoy being on top of the world while it lasts.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:18.250
Bye!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.630
No, hold on!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:22.000
W-wait a minute!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.630
Her again, eh?
W-wait a minute!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:24.500
Are you-
W-wait a minute!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:25.000
Are you-
Stay! Don't roll into the street!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.630
Stay! Don't roll into the street!

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.880
Beginning at 5:00 tomorrow,

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:33.790
we'll be meeting face-to-face with
the bands we're competing against.

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:37.080
After tomorrow, we're extending
our practice time by two hours.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.790
We've booked as much studio time
as we possibly can over the weekend.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:42.960
Please make sure this doesn't conflict
with your individual schedules.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:47.880
We've got a tough road ahead of us, but it feels like
FUTURE WORLD FES is finally happening!

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:49.380
I'm gonna kick some butt!

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:51.420
You can count on me, too!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.880
Speaking of which...

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:58.380
I think we should enter
the "BanG Dream! Girls Band Challenge."

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.330
What?!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.330
Are you serious?

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:06.250
Wait a sec, Yukina.
What about FUTURE WORLD FES?

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.710
We'll still perform, of course.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:10.790
I'm glad you changed your mind, but...

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:11.880
But we...

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:16.960
We're supposed to focus these next few months
on getting ready for FUTURE WORLD FES.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:20.420
That's the whole reason why we put together
such a brutal schedule.

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.460
I know.

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:22.750
Then why?

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.500
We're alike.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.460
PAREO, jerky!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.170
Someone's in a bad mood.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.670
She slipped through my grasp!

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.580
Aren't you the one who chased her away?

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.750
You can't catch someone without chasing them!

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:54.170
Whatever.

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:55.580
Later.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:56.880
You're going home?

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.880
Yup.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.000
Halloween

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.000
Fair

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:07.960
Sh-she wouldn't follow me to my job, would she...?

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:14.710
Rokka-chan.

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:19.290
I'm sorry!

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:21.830
You scared me...

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.210
Sorry for sneaking up on you.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.960
You're welcome to use the stage
after you finish cleaning up.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.580
Thank you!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.830
I just can't make sense of it...

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:35.790
Today was exhaustin'...

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:40.080
Showin' up at my school outta the blue like that...

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:44.170
Does this mean you're opposed to joining a band?

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:46.880
No, that's not...

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:49.250
Out of all our potential candidates,

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:52.170
CHU2-sama has found herself
most interested in your talents.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:55.000
And we would welcome you with open arms.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.880
Come visit us whenever you like.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:24.460
What the...?

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.580
This girl...

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:01.130
Masuki-san! Here to practice?

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.880
Come with me.

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:11.420
Are you gonna squish me?! You are, aren't you?!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:14.250
What's that supposed to be? Some kinda slang?

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.210
Cold... Cold!

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.710
Wh-where are we going...?!

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:43.630
What a fancy building...

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.750
Don't fall backwards.

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:48.920
Th..thank-

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:49.830
Let's go.

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:55.500
Massu-san?

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.080
I thought you were going home...

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:01.250
Brought you a present.

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:03.000
Welcome!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.080
Where are we?!

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:07.210
This is CHU2-sama's private studio!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.830
Are you alright?

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:12.290
No, not even close!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.790
The poor thing's scared to death.

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.750
Changed your mind about joining, eh?

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:19.170
We'll see.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:21.630
The music doesn't lie. Time for a session.

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:29.330
You ain't stopped screamin' since we left the venue.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.500
You good?

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.710
Massu-san seems to be enjoying herself.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:36.000
What do we do?

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:37.040
Good question...

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:39.790
I want you to go absolutely nuts.

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.880
S-sorry to intrude...

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:47.460
What should we play?

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:51.790
"R-I-O-T." Once she's heard a tune,
she can play it by ear.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.960
Okay, show me what you got.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:01.790
Come into the world
Come into the world

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:07.330
Hibikiwataru no wa zetsumyou na sonzai igi no concerto
A perfect concerto of raison d'etre resounds

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:10.790
Buatsui rule wa yaburisutete
Tear down the oppressives rule

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:14.170
Let's shake it down! Saa koe takaku
Let's shake it down! Come on, louder

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:18.130
Kikoeta no nara...
If you heard me...

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:23.130
Just follow me, and trust me
Just follow me, and trust me

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:39.920
Shouri no megami kara always netsushisen ukete
Always under the heated gaze of the goddess of victory

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.580
Passions run R-I-O-T
Passions run R-I-O-T

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:43.420
Passions run R-I-O-T
Passions run R-I-O-T

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:47.170
Muteki na flavor o matowasu
You're surrounded by an unrivaled flavor

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:53.630
Sassa to shirohata o futte kousan shina to
So just wave the white flag and surrender now

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.380
Passions run R-I-O-T
Passions run R-I-O-T

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.290
Passions run R-I-O-T
Passions run R-I-O-T

00:20:57.290 --> 00:21:00.790
Muda na arasoi ni wa get tired
I'm tired of fighting meaningless battles

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:07.580
Kozaiku wa iranai shoumen kara go ahead
No need for tricks, go ahead, face 'em head on

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:14.630
Sakaraenai shougeki de bang!
Hit 'em so hard they can't oppose you, bang!

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:27.210
Not bad, huh? You fit right in.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.330
Oh yes, you were wonderful!

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.710
Somethin' ain't right...

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:39.790
U-um...?

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:44.920
I don't need music that censors itself
to comfort other people.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:47.960
Sorry.

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.330
You fail.

00:23:35.170 --> 00:23:37.710
Next Time: I'm Not Leaving!
